      "writtenOn": "2026-07-12T14:42:55Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The code loops using pos \u003d mf.name.find(from, pos + to.size());.\nIf from is \"__\" and to is \"_\", substituting \"__\" with \"_\" shortens the string.\n\nThe Issue: pos + to.size() advances the search index by 1. If your metric name contains three underscores in a row (___), replacing the first two leaves __. Because you advanced the index past the first character of this new pair, you might skip it or, in other string-replacement contexts, risk infinite loops if the replacement text contains the search text.\n\nFix: When replacing substrings where the to string cannot trigger a new match at the current position, it\u0027s safer to simply search from pos or compute the next position dynamically based on the updated layout.",
